ap" id="mwAWs">3 July</span> 2020</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=A+History+of+Modern+Librarianship%3A+Constructing+the+Heritage+of+Western+Cultures&amp;rft.pages=170&amp;rft.pub=Libraries+Unlimited&amp;rft.date=2015-05-26&amp;rft.isbn=978-1610690997&amp;rft.aulast=Richard&amp;rft.aufirst=Pamela+Spence&amp;rft.au=Wiegand%2C+Wayne+A.&amp;rft.au=Dalbello%2C+Marija&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3DNei6CAAAQBAJ&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ABibliotheca+Alexandrina" class="Z3988" about="#mwt16" id="mwAWw"></span></span></li>
